on enterFrame
  [  0] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  1] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  2] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  3] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  4] pushint8 5 .............................. <5>
  [  7] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  8] pushint8 3 .............................. <3>
  [ 11] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 12] pushcons 0 .............................. <"Dprocess">
  [ 14] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 15] getfield ................................ <field("Dprocess")>
  [ 16] getchunk ................................ <item 5 of line 3 of field "Dprocess">
  [ 17] pushcons 8 .............................. <"done">
  [ 19] eq ...................................... <item 5 of line 3 of field "Dprocess" = "done">
  [ 20] jmpifz [ 38] ............................ if item 5 of line 3 of field "Dprocess" = "done" then / else
  [ 23] pushint8 23 ............................. <23>
  [ 26] pusharglist 1 ........................... <23>
  [ 28] extcall 94 .............................. <sprite(23)>
  [ 31] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 32] setobjprop 95 ........................... sprite(23).visible = 0
  [ 35] jmp [ 52]
  [ 38] pushint8 23 ............................. <23>
  [ 41] pusharglist 1 ........................... <23>
  [ 43] extcall 94 .............................. <sprite(23)>
  [ 46] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 49] setobjprop 95 ........................... sprite(23).visible = 1
  [ 52] ret
end
